      "role": "user",
      "content": "sorry, what do you mean by goblins? i'm just trying to figure out the legal stuff for my audit. can you just stick to the actual gdpr requirements for data security and how i should handle potential data breaches? i need to know what my legal obligations are if someone accesses my customer list.",
